WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.169 --> 00:00:07.169
Hi everyone. In this section, we're going to go over how to use Web Remote using Level Snapshot Interaction,

2
00:00:07.169 --> 00:00:12.169
and we're going to control one of our lights using our RCP and our Web Remote tools.

3
00:00:12.169 --> 00:00:13.169
So let's get started.

4
00:00:13.169 --> 00:00:17.170
You'll see on my screen here on the left that I have two tabs.

5
00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:22.170
I have one tab that has my light properties all placed in, which I demonstrated how to do earlier.

6
00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:27.170
And we also, underneath on the left here, we have a Snapshot tab.

7
00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:31.170
Now, you're probably wondering, how did I get to this particular spot?

8
00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:38.259
What I did was I simply clicked on plus, and when I clicked on plus, I can choose Snapshot.

9
00:00:38.259 --> 00:00:42.259
And that's basically how I got that rolling and working in the right direction.

10
00:00:42.259 --> 00:00:47.460
So what I'm going to do now is I'm going to go to my iPad,

11
00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:51.460
